{"seq":2,"slug":"goodparts-outbound-inventory-hold","title":"好件发出库存预占与订单编排","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/spare-parts-rma-reverse-network/rma-goodparts-outbound/goodparts-outbound-inventory-hold","wordCount":2751,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"好件发出库存预占与订单编排\">好件发出库存预占与订单编排</h1><p>上一节把 RMA 判定做成了授权门。门一开，系统就欠买家一件货——问题立刻从「判不判」变成「从哪发、什么时候锁库存、货没到之前那件库存算谁的」。跨境场景下这个动作比国内复杂一个数量级：好件可能躺在保税仓、可能躺在境外维修中心、也可能还在另一批 RMA 的回程在途上。<strong>预占（hold/reservation）</strong> 就是把这句承诺落成一条可审计、可释放、可幂等重放的库存记录，而 <strong>订单编排（order orchestration）</strong> 决定这条记录指向哪个节点、走哪条合规通道。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-预占不是扣减-atp-才是真实可售\">核心概念：预占不是扣减，ATP 才是真实可售</h2><p>销售库存的逻辑是「下单即扣减」：库存表减一，发货后落账。备件换新不能照抄这套动作，因为 RMA 出库存在一个销售订单没有的阶段——<strong>授权已发但坏件未必回来</strong>。若在授权瞬间直接扣减好件库存，一次大规模换新活动会把可用量打穿，而实际发货可能因为买家未寄回坏件而永远不发生。</p>\n<p>正确的做法是把库存量拆成三个可加总的口径：<strong>在库（on-hand）</strong>、<strong>已预占（reserved）</strong>、<strong>可承诺量（Available-to-Promise，ATP）</strong>。ATP 是编排器唯一应该相信的数字：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>ATP</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>OnHand</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>InboundScheduled</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>Reserved</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>SafetyStock</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{ATP} = \\text{OnHand} + \\text{InboundScheduled} - \\text{Reserved} - \\text{SafetyStock}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ATP</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">OnHand</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">InboundScheduled</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Reserved</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SafetyStock</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <code>Reserved</code> 是所有未释放、未发运的预占集合，<code>InboundScheduled</code> 是已知会到货的维修返工件或跨境调拨在途件，<code>SafetyStock</code> 是该 SKU 层（见 <a href=\"../spare-parts-network-layout/spare-sku-tiers-safety-stock\">备件 SKU 分层与安全库存建模</a>）不可动用的保底量。这套口径与 ERP/APS 领域标准的 ATP 概念一致，核心区别在于：备件网络的 <code>InboundScheduled</code> 里有很大一块来自逆向端维修良品的回流，而不是采购订单。</p>\n<p>预占记录本身要携带足够信息才能被正确释放与审计：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>缺失后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>rma_id</code></td>\n<td>关联授权，幂等键</td>\n<td>重复预占、重复发件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>sku</code> + <code>serial</code></td>\n<td>精确到件或到型号</td>\n<td>高值件串号错发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>node</code></td>\n<td>预占所在库存节点</td>\n<td>释放时找错仓</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>qty</code></td>\n<td>数量</td>\n<td>ATP 计算错误</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>hold_type</code></td>\n<td>软占 / 硬占 / 在途占</td>\n<td>过早扣减或无限期占用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>expires_at</code></td>\n<td>预占过期时间</td>\n<td>僵尸占用，ATP 虚低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>state</code></td>\n<td><code>HELD</code>/<code>RELEASED</code>/<code>CONSUMED</code></td>\n<td>无法对账</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表就是编排器的状态真相源：<strong>任何库存变动都必须以一条预占记录的状态迁移来表达</strong>，而不是直接改库存数。这样对账时可重放，异常时可回滚。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三种预占语义-软占-硬占-在途占\">三种预占语义：软占、硬占、在途占</h2><p>预占不是单一动作，而是按业务风险分层的三档强度，选错档位会同时产生缺货和僵尸库存两种相反的故障。</p>\n<p><strong>软占（soft hold）</strong> 只写意图、不冻结物理量，用于「先行发件」在授权阶段但发货尚未排产的时刻。软占的意义是让 ATP 提前看到这单需求，避免同一件好件被两个 RMA 同时承诺；它可被并行覆盖，冲突时按优先级裁决。<strong>硬占（hard hold）</strong> 把具体库存（对高值件是具体序列号）锁定到 <code>rma_id</code> 名下，其他订单不得动用，用于发货波次已生成、拣货单已下发的阶段。<strong>在途占（in-transit hold）</strong> 占用的是尚未到货的 <code>InboundScheduled</code>，典型场景是维修中心已判定良品、正在回程，或保税仓调拨已发运——允许「未到先卖」是跨境备件网络缩短交付周期的关键杠杆，代价是必须扣住对应的在途单，否则到货被别的订单抢走就变成超卖。</p>\n<p>档位与 RMA 处置类型的对应关系决定了风险敞口：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>处置类型</th>\n<th>授权时预占档位</th>\n<th>发货波次后</th>\n<th>过期策略</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>换新（先收货后发件）</td>\n<td>软占（低优先级）</td>\n<td>硬占</td>\n<td>收件超期自动释放</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>换新（先行发件，有押金）</td>\n<td>硬占</td>\n<td>硬占</td>\n<td>押金未授权则降级释放</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>换新（先行发件，高分买家）</td>\n<td>软占</td>\n<td>硬占</td>\n<td>短 TTL，超时转人工</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>维修（借出备机）</td>\n<td>硬占 + 归还期限</td>\n<td>硬占</td>\n<td>归还后转 <code>CONSUMED</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键约束是 <strong>TTL（time-to-live）</strong>：软占必须有明确过期时间，过期未转硬占即自动释放，否则 ATP 会被永久侵蚀。上节提到的资格分阈值与押金策略，在这里落地成「什么档位 + 多长 TTL」这一组参数——高风险买家不给硬占、不给长 TTL，是同一件事的两种表述（<a href=\"rma-intake-authorization-eligibility\">RMA 受理与授权资格判定模型</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多节点寻源-一件备件从哪个仓出\">多节点寻源：一件备件从哪个仓出</h2><p>预占解决「锁多少」，编排解决「从哪出」。跨境备件网络的库存分散在多个节点类型：国内主仓、海外前置仓、保税仓（未清关）、境外维修中心的良品池、以及逆向在途。寻源是把一条 RMA 需求映射到「节点 + 运输通道 + 承诺时效」的优化问题，目标函数通常是<strong>总落地成本最小且满足承诺时效</strong>的约束最优：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow></munder><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msubsup><mi>c</mi><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>c</mi><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>c</mi><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>s.t.</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>n</mi></munder><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\min \\sum_{n \\in N} x_n \\left( c_n^{goods} + c_n^{freight} + c_n^{duty} \\right) \\quad \\text{s.t.} \\quad \\sum_{n} x_n = 1,\\; t_n \\le t^{promise}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3717em;vertical-align:-1.3217em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3217em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">oo</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">s.t.</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.9em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.25em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8747em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8747em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">mi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_n \\in \\{0,1\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6891em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span> 表示是否从节点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 发件，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>c</mi><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_n^{duty}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0961em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是跨境独有的关税成本项——这正是国内寻源不需要考虑的。保税仓发货在清关前不产生进口税，但发往买家所在国时仍需按当地规则完税；境外维修中心发件可能被认定为本地供给而绕开进口环节。寻源器必须在候选集里显式建模这三项成本，否则会系统性地偏向「离家最近」的仓而忽略税费。</p>\n<p>编排决策必须同时满足的硬约束：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>可用性</strong>：节点 ATP 足够，且预占档位可满足。</li>\n<li><strong>合规通道</strong>：含锂电池的备件受航空危险品规则约束，出库必须标记危品渠道，否则会被承运人拒收（<a href=\"https://www.iata.org/en/programs/cargo/dgr/lithium-batteries/\">IATA: 锂电池运输</a>）。</li>\n<li><strong>序列号/批次</strong>：高值件绑定具体序列号，寻源不能跨序列号分配。</li>\n<li><strong>承诺时效</strong>：节点到买家的预估时效必须落在 RMA 承诺窗口内。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一旦寻源选定节点，编排器立刻把软占升级为硬占并固定 <code>node</code>；若寻源失败（ATP 不足或通道不可用），不能静默失败，必须回落到「拆分发货、延期承诺或转人工」三选一，并把原因写回 RMA 记录供买家沟通。</p>\n<h2 id=\"跨境发件的合规编排-完税-危品与贸易术语\">跨境发件的合规编排：完税、危品与贸易术语</h2><p>跨境换新件有一个国内订单不存在的动作序列：<strong>发件本身可能触发报关与纳税</strong>。免费保修的替换件是否征税，各国规则不同，编排器必须能区分「免费更换」与「有偿销售」两种申报口径，否则会在口岸被卡或补税。欧盟海关估值规则对免费更换件有专门处理，允许在特定条件下只对替换件本身估值而非按整机重复计税（<a href=\"https://taxation-customs.ec.europa.eu/customs-4/customs-procedures-import-and-export-3/customs-valuation_en\">欧盟委员会：海关估值手册</a>）。美国侧对返修后再进口的货物有单独的章级规则，关税通常只按「维修增值」计征而非整机价值（<a href=\"https://hts.usitc.gov/\">USITC: Harmonized Tariff Schedule，第 98 章</a>）。</p>\n<p>贸易术语的选择同样影响成本与责任边界。跨境换新件常用 DDP（卖方完税交货）以便买家零负担，但这把进口税与清关责任全部压给卖方，编排器必须在发件前就把税费计入落地成本，而不是等到清关账单。若走 DAP（买方承担进口税费），则必须在 RMA 沟通里明确告知买家可能产生关税，否则会触发拒收——这是跨境售后最常见的纠纷源之一（<a href=\"https://iccwbo.org/business-solutions/incoterms-rules/incoterms-2020/\">ICC: Incoterms 2020</a>）。</p>\n<p>合规编排的输出是一张<strong>发件指令</strong>：节点、通道（普货/危品）、贸易术语、申报口径（免费更换/有偿）、序列号、以及关税预估。它既是仓库作业依据，也是报关行申报依据。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[RMA 授权&lt;br/&gt;处置=换新] --&gt; B[创建软占&lt;br/&gt;绑定 rma_id]&#10;    B --&gt; C{寻源: 选节点}&#10;    C --&gt;|ATP 足够| D[升级硬占&lt;br/&gt;固定 node+serial]&#10;    C --&gt;|ATP 不足| E[回落: 拆分/延期/转人工]&#10;    D --&gt; F{合规检查}&#10;    F --&gt;|含锂电池| G[标记危品通道]&#10;    F --&gt;|跨境| H[定贸易术语+申报口径&lt;br/&gt;估关税]&#10;    F --&gt;|境内| I[普货出库]&#10;    G --&gt; J[生成发件指令]&#10;    H --&gt; J&#10;    I --&gt; J&#10;    J --&gt; K[拣货/打包/报关/发运]&#10;    K --&gt; L[预占 CONSUMED&lt;br/&gt;释放并发运]&#10;    K --&gt;|发货失败| M[回滚预占&lt;br/&gt;软占 or 释放]&#10;    M --&gt; C\">graph TD\n    A[RMA 授权&lt;br/&gt;处置=换新] --&gt; B[创建软占&lt;br/&gt;绑定 rma_id]\n    B --&gt; C{寻源: 选节点}\n    C --&gt;|ATP 足够| D[升级硬占&lt;br/&gt;固定 node+serial]\n    C --&gt;|ATP 不足| E[回落: 拆分/延期/转人工]\n    D --&gt; F{合规检查}\n    F --&gt;|含锂电池| G[标记危品通道]\n    F --&gt;|跨境| H[定贸易术语+申报口径&lt;br/&gt;估关税]\n    F --&gt;|境内| I[普货出库]\n    G --&gt; J[生成发件指令]\n    H --&gt; J\n    I --&gt; J\n    J --&gt; K[拣货/打包/报关/发运]\n    K --&gt; L[预占 CONSUMED&lt;br/&gt;释放并发运]\n    K --&gt;|发货失败| M[回滚预占&lt;br/&gt;软占 or 释放]\n    M --&gt; C</pre><h2 id=\"编排状态机与幂等\">编排状态机与幂等</h2><p>编排器本质是一个<strong>状态机 + 幂等执行器</strong>。每个 RMA 的库存预占经历 <code>HELD → CONSUMED</code>（正常发运）或 <code>HELD → RELEASED</code>（取消/超期）两条主干，中间可能出现 <code>→ HELD(node 变更)</code> 的重新寻源。工程上最容易出错的不是状态定义，而是<strong>重试语义</strong>：跨境发货链路上，报关超时、承运商接口 5xx、消息队列重复投递都会导致同一指令被重复执行。</p>\n<p>因此每条编排指令必须以 <code>rma_id + sku + hold_type</code> 作为幂等键。重复的「创建预占」请求命中已有记录则直接返回，不再新增；重复的「释放」请求对已释放记录是空操作。这与资源生命周期原则一致：一个有副作用的操作必须可被安全重放，超时不等于什么都没发生——超时后应先查询远端状态再决定重试还是回滚，而不是盲目重发导致双重预占或双重发货。</p>\n<p>对账是编排器的最后一道防线。每日应比对三个集合是否闭合：<strong>预占集合</strong>（<code>Reserved</code>）、<strong>发运集合</strong>（已 <code>CONSUMED</code> 的出库单）、<strong>逆向集合</strong>（已回收的坏件）。任何一条 <code>HELD</code> 超过 TTL 仍在占用、或 <code>CONSUMED</code> 却查无出库单的记录，都是需要对账脚本抓出的异常。跨境场景下还要额外核对<strong>报关状态</strong>：货已发运但报关仍挂起的订单，可能因申报错误被退回，此时预占已 <code>CONSUMED</code> 而货实际退回——这类需要人工介入的挂起单必须进入专门的异常队列，而非静默消失在流程里。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>预占不是扣减：备件换新必须用 <strong>ATP = OnHand + InboundScheduled − Reserved − SafetyStock</strong> 的可承诺量口径，因为「授权已发、坏件未必回」是销售订单没有的阶段。</li>\n<li>每条预占记录都是状态真相源，携带 <code>rma_id</code>/<code>node</code>/<code>hold_type</code>/<code>expires_at</code>/<code>state</code>；库存变动一律以状态迁移表达，才能对账与回滚。</li>\n<li>预占强度分三档——软占（写意图）、硬占（锁物理量/序列号）、在途占（占用未到货的回流件）；档位与 TTL 必须与 RMA 资格分、押金策略挂钩。</li>\n<li>寻源是「总落地成本最小且满足承诺时效」的约束优化，跨境独有的成本项是<strong>关税</strong>；含锂电池件必须标危品通道。</li>\n<li>跨境发件要区分「免费更换」与「有偿销售」申报口径，贸易术语（DDP/DAP）决定税费责任归属，须在发件前计入成本。</li>\n<li>编排器是状态机 + 幂等执行器：以 <code>rma_id+sku+hold_type</code> 为幂等键，超时先查远端状态再重试，避免双重预占与双重发货。</li>\n<li>每日对账必须闭合预占、发运、逆向三集合，并对跨境订单额外核对报关状态，把挂起单送入异常队列。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"好件发出库存预占与订单编排","id":"好件发出库存预占与订单编排"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：预占不是扣减，ATP 才是真实可售","id":"核心概念-预占不是扣减-atp-才是真实可售"},{"level":2,"text":"三种预占语义：软占、硬占、在途占","id":"三种预占语义-软占-硬占-在途占"},{"level":2,"text":"多节点寻源：一件备件从哪个仓出","id":"多节点寻源-一件备件从哪个仓出"},{"level":2,"text":"跨境发件的合规编排：完税、危品与贸易术语","id":"跨境发件的合规编排-完税-危品与贸易术语"},{"level":2,"text":"编排状态机与幂等","id":"编排状态机与幂等"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"RMA 受理与授权资格判定模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/spare-parts-rma-reverse-network/rma-goodparts-outbound/rma-intake-authorization-eligibility"},"next":{"title":"RMA 关税退税与发出异常处置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/spare-parts-rma-reverse-network/rma-goodparts-outbound/rma-duty-drawback-exception"}}